  ins=["Reported file paths are relative to the invocation directory","getrepr gains an optional cwd argument","Deleted-cwd OSError fallback retained"],
  outs=["Changing nodeid or rootdir computation","Changing --rootdir or invocation_dir semantics","Altering abspath handling","Editing test files"],
  dec=["Thread an explicit cwd through getrepr instead of capturing a global initial-cwd inside code.py, so the formatter stays free of config knowledge and defaults to today's behaviour.","Use config.invocation_dir rather than rootdir: the issue is about the directory the user ran pytest from (their editor's cwd), which is what invocation_dir records."],
